# This image ships the environment only -- the pipeline code and the trained model are
# mounted at run time (see the Dockerfile header). So the build context needs nothing
# except yamls/pyxel_env_crossplatform.yml, and excluding the rest keeps the context tiny
# (the repo carries a 2.1 GB classifiers/ dir and a ~3 GB .git).
*
!yamls/pyxel_env_crossplatform.yml
